# MF Overhaul 0.3.48: user: "explosions look less powerful due to how fast smoke and dust dissipate; both have to match the power
#   of the explosion, organic, proportional to the explosive power". After 0.3.46/0.3.47 the bomb tier had shrunk to the medium
#   tier's size. One ladder now, each step ~1.5x the one below in size, amount and duration:
#            smoke: puffs  start->end   life  rise      dust: puffs  start->end   life
#   small    8      1 -> 10 m    14 s  +0.08         8      1.5 -> 10 m  14 s      (76 mm, 105-122 mm, mortars)
#   medium   10     2 -> 18 m    22 s  +0.06         14     3 -> 18 m    22 s      (152 mm)
#   big      14     3 -> 28 m    32 s  +0.04         20     4 -> 28 m    32 s      (21 / 28 cm rockets, aerial bombs)
#   Fade points: smoke 0.3 (bomb 0.4), dust 0.2. Opacity (smoke 0xB8, dust 0xA0), hue and the low fast dust spread unchanged.
